* crossbar: W=+1 populates Rxp (to sn), W=-1 populates Rxn (to sp), as on the board
Rxp0 t0 sn {{RXP0}}
Rxn0 t0 sp {{RXN0}}
Rxp1 t1 sn {{RXP1}}
Rxn1 t1 sp {{RXN1}}
Rxp2 t2 sn {{RXP2}}
Rxn2 t2 sp {{RXN2}}
Rxp3 t3 sn {{RXP3}}
Rxn3 t3 sp {{RXN3}}
Rxp4 t4 sn {{RXP4}}
