Rxp6 t6 sn {{RXP6}}
Rxn6 t6 sp {{RXN6}}
Rxp7 t7 sn {{RXP7}}
Rxn7 t7 sp {{RXN7}}
Xs1 ref sn on OPA
Rfn sn on 1058
Cfn sn on 15p
Xs2 ref sp op OPA
Rfp sp op 1058
Cfp sp op 15p
* generic BJT pair, mirror-less 1 mA ideal tail (the board uses a BJT mirror; see tap/dc exports for the full tile)
Q1 c1 on tail QNPN
Q2 c2 op tail QNPN
Itail tail 0 1m
Rl1 vdd c1 1k
Rl2 vdd c2 1k
Eout out 0 c2 c1 1
.end
